  description: "Five Dragonborn warriors, a Sergeant and four Footmen (10 health, Armor Level 2, 75% accuracy each), armed with Dragon Glaives: polearms with a rifle built into the head. They shoot out to 20 m (5 damage, penetration 1), and when an enemy comes within 2 m they switch to the blade (5 damage, penetration 2, +25% accuracy). Tough for infantry, but slow at 10 m a move. Infantry can be taken more than once."
